{
  "demo_page": "docs/demo.html",
  "viewport": {
    "height": 720,
    "width": 1280
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 5
        }
      ],
      "caption": "AI reads, reasons and asks; code counts.",
      "duration": 6,
      "id": "thesis",
      "page": "card:thesis",
      "title": "thesis card"
    },
    {
      "actions": [],
      "caption": "1 · Read & verify",
      "duration": 1,
      "id": "ch1",
      "page": "card:ch1",
      "title": "chapter 1"
    },
    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "button.fpick[data-ex=\"S2_seoul_worker_bronchitis\"]"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "#flow-play"
        },
        {
          "op": "zoom",
          "scale": 1.35,
          "selector": "#flow-steps"
        },
        {
          "op": "wait_for",
          "selector": "#flow-view .flow-result"
        },
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "op": "unzoom"
        },
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 1
        }
      ],
      "caption": "Drop a hospital bill. Muse Spark reads every numbered cell, code re-adds them, and a rule decides which insurance applies.",
      "duration": 14,
      "id": "s2flow",
      "page": "demo",
      "title": "S2 guided flow"
    },
    {
      "actions": [],
      "caption": "2 · Show the source",
      "duration": 1,
      "id": "ch2",
      "page": "card:ch2",
      "title": "chapter 2"
    },
    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "#scenes button:has-text(\"Scene S2\")"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "section#S2_seoul_worker_bronchitis .headline [data-prov=\"s2-amount\"]"
        },
        {
          "op": "wait_for",
          "selector": "#prov-panel .plink"
        },
        {
          "op": "zoom",
          "scale": 1.3,
          "selector": "#prov-panel"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "#prov-panel .plink[data-goto=\"s2-ded-ours\"]"
        },
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 2
        },
        {
          "op": "unzoom"
        },
        {
          "op": "move",
          "selector": "section#S2_seoul_worker_bronchitis .pinned"
        },
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 1
        }
      ],
      "caption": "Every number can show where it came from: the receipt cells, the copay formula, the three deductible terms — and our own check matches the engine.",
      "duration": 15,
      "id": "prov",
      "page": "demo",
      "title": "provenance panel"
    },
    {
      "actions": [],
      "caption": "3 · Ask, don't guess",
      "duration": 1,
      "id": "ch3",
      "page": "card:ch3",
      "title": "chapter 3"
    },
    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "#scenes button:has-text(\"Scene Agent\")"
        },
        {
          "op": "scroll_to",
          "selector": "section#agent_s2_hidden_copay ol.timeline"
        },
        {
          "op": "scroll_to",
          "selector": "section#agent_s2_hidden_copay .tl-q"
        },
        {
          "op": "zoom",
          "ms": 700,
          "scale": 1.6,
          "selector": "section#agent_s2_hidden_copay .tl-q"
        },
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 3
        },
        {
          "op": "unzoom"
        },
        {
          "op": "hold",
          "seconds": 1
        }
      ],
      "caption": "Hide two cells and the checks fail. The agent does not guess: it asks for exactly what is missing, and says why — then finishes the claim.",
      "duration": 14,
      "id": "agent",
      "page": "demo",
      "title": "agent timeline"
    },
    {
      "actions": [],
      "caption": "We score it: it asks when it must, stays quiet when it need not, and never invents a number.",
      "duration": 7,
      "id": "score",
      "page": "agent-eval",
      "title": "agent scorecard"
    },
    {
      "actions": [],
      "caption": "4 · No policy, no decision",
      "duration": 1,
      "id": "ch4",
      "page": "card:ch4",
      "title": "chapter 4"
    },
    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "click",
          "selector": "#scenes button:has-text(\"Scene S3\")"
        },
        {
          "op": "scroll_to",
          "selector": "section#S3_us_tourist_hip_fracture h3:has-text(\"Verify\")"
